# Student Dashboard Rules

Student dashboard pages:
- /dashboard
- /dashboard/profile
- /dashboard/applications
- /dashboard/documents
- /dashboard/consultations
- /dashboard/notifications
- /dashboard/settings

Student can:
- View profile
- Update basic information
- View application status
- Upload documents
- See missing documents
- View counselor notes meant for student
- Book consultation
- Receive notifications

Document statuses:
- pending_review
- approved
- rejected
- needs_update

Rules:
- Students can only access their own data.
- Students cannot edit application status directly.
- Students cannot approve documents.
- Students cannot view other students.
- Use progress/timeline UI for application tracking.
- Use clear labels and simple language.
